id: pm-brand-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T21:41:24.612Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T23:30:45.589Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[18]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:41:30.089Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T21:50:03.656Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 38/38, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-14T21:50:52.786Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Added refusal coverage for canonical callers missing owner approval or bypassing it with a truthy alternative. The final caller and approval suite passes 40/40, zero failures/skips, extending the prior 38-test baseline. Package lint also passes. Both npm and Bun gates remain selected through release:check:all. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker comment; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-14T22:26:57.174Z",codex-ops272-1114,"The released canonical transaction already executes the configured release:check script through npm and verifyBunScript. Removed the redundant release:check:all wrapper and input so each npm/Bun gate runs once. Both gates remain enforced by the released workflow. Final caller/approval tests pass 40/40, zero failures/skips. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-15T00:16:19.814Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 audit found release-copy remnants or package-level regression tests needing restoration. Keep the pinned caller and package hooks; remove obsolete local release orchestration and stale references, restore independent package behavior tests, and retarget mutation proofs to the caller contract. Run touched tests, unchanged coverage gates, typecheck and lint, then regenerate and check the changelog after final tracker writes. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
  "2026-11-15T01:04:21.177Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brand/pull/49: Removed the obsolete tag-mutation proof and the inline-workflow part of the text proof. Kept all three package text algorithm proofs and corrected the README changelog contract. Targeted tests passed 14/14. Full npm run coverage certification is delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds. npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed. Retirement contract passes and restoring only a retired artefact fails in a disposable copy. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker, keeping run artefacts outside this tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. CI must verify the pushed head; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-19T02:04:18.994Z",codex-sol,"Daily Release candidate PR #53 for 2026.10.17 failed with Live publication identity disagrees. npm published at 2026-11-15T19:45:48.205Z before trusted preparation at 2026-11-16T11:46:09Z. No attestation, tag, GitHub Release or recorded workflow publication attempt exists for this intent. The protected merge matches the receipt. Read-only replay at c46a241 returns occupied and retains the historical receipt on retirement. Pin the shared workflow to v2026.11.18 with existing inputs and permissions."
  "2026-11-19T02:08:27.927Z",codex-sol,The linked release caller contract and changelog check both passed. Rollout is pending review and scheduled reconciliation.
  "2026-11-19T03:41:25.295Z",codex-sol,"Updated docs/release-caller-rollout.md to the pm-ops v2026.11.18 caller SHA c46a2419c63af3b348e6b559b0733ab0d9942cc7. Pinned the package-side pm-ops dev dependency and lockfile to 2026.11.18 (previously 2026.11.14). With tags fetched, npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. The caller tests passed 7/7, the linked documentation contracts passed 41/41, and npm run typecheck passed."
  "2026-11-19T09:00:36.688Z",codex-sol,Round DL updates README install instructions for the published package and verifies each documented archive path in a fresh consumer.
  "2026-11-19T09:42:22.758Z",codex-sol,"Round DL updated the registry and local archive instructions. npm run build && node --test test/release-approval.test.ts test/workflows.test.ts passed (37 passing, 0 skipped). npm run typecheck, npm run docstring and npm run test:install passed. All 1 README archive example(s) executed successfully in fresh consumers with the version produced by the source checkout. The changelog generation and check passed with tags fetched."
  "2026-11-19T13:14:28.158Z",codex-sol,"Round DP follows up the archive installation and release documentation review. Verify pack failure and empty output with stubbed commands, and run the package installation and changelog gates directly."
  "2026-11-19T13:35:05.494Z",codex-sol,Packed npm acceptance passed. Bun reached registry dependency resolution but exceeded the installation watchdog. Retry the existing acceptance gate with its supported watchdog scaling.
  "2026-11-19T13:42:27.907Z",codex-sol,"Round DP verified the guarded README archive sequences, typecheck, docstring, packed installation, and changelog regeneration and check with fetched tags. Release documentation requires the npm trusted publisher for release.yml and records the separate repository approval gate. Leave this rollout item open and release its claim."
  "2026-11-19T18:50:56.428Z",codex-sol,"Round EA scopes the README archive commands to a subshell. The regression tests will exercise pack failure, empty output, and a missing archive, and verify that the calling shell continues."
  "2026-11-19T19:10:56.348Z",codex-sol,"Round EA: The README archive block runs in a subshell. Pack failure, empty output, and a missing archive each abort the archive commands before installation and return control to interactive Bash. README and documentation tests (38), docstring, typecheck, lint, packed install acceptance, and full changelog regeneration and check passed. The rollout item remains open."
  "2026-11-19T22:44:49.659Z",codex-sol,"Round ED: follow up on npm direct-publish permission and verify that archive examples stop before installing if consumer setup fails, then check the installed version. Exercise the README commands against mocked failure paths and run the package gates."
  "2026-11-19T23:30:37.464Z",codex-sol,"Round ED verification: verified the npm Allowed actions prerequisite against the linked npm documentation. The README checks cover pack, directory creation, directory entry, installation failure, and matching and mismatched installed versions. README and documentation tests passed (13 passed, 0 skipped). Build, docstring, typecheck, lint, npm run test:install, and full changelog regeneration and check with fetched tags passed."
